      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1768173066031,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n\nBuild Robinhood, \n1. system should order processing for user (buy market )\n2. user should be able to watch (multiple) stock price of any given\n    stock in real time\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n1. Order processing should Consistent, rest of the system should be highly\n    available\n2. Should support low latency stock price updates (P99 < 1 sec)\n3. Fault tolerant processing of orders\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n\nBuild Robinhood, \n1. system should order processing for user (buy market )\n2. user should be able to watch (multiple) stock price of any given\n    stock in real time\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n1. Order processing should Consistent, rest of the system should be highly\n    available\n2. Should support low latency stock price updates (P99 < 1 sec)\n3. Fault tolerant processing of orders\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
